Studio REQ-STUDIO-TRUST-OWN-FOLDERS: folders Studio itself created open trusted, with no Workspace Trust modal.
Off unless the user-local setting hypeproofChat.trustStudioFolders is true; the core reads it itself at decision time (inspect().userLocalValue), so turning it off applies to the very next session.
Core trusts a local folder only when ALL hold: flag on, chat extension not disabled, learner never chose "Don't Trust" for it, its real path is in the extension record (written only when Studio created the leaf folder) and its creation time matches the recorded one. Every other folder prompts as upstream. Workspace trust stays enabled globally.
Hand-maintained: edit by applying to scripts/patches/core/upstream, then write git diff back under this header.

